The contract implements a fund management system but fails to validate payment recipients, allowing unauthorized fund distribution.

### Vulnerability: Unchecked Payment Receiver
### Explanation: The distribute_funds function validates transaction properties but does not verify the recipient address of the payment transaction, allowing the owner to send funds to any address regardless of authorization status.
### Risk: High - Allows complete drainage of contract funds to arbitrary addresses
